- Eligible for removal.


9. USER CONTROL

Storage management must preserve Human Control.

The system must not autonomously delete valuable user data merely to optimize storage.

Any destructive or irreversible operation must follow explicit policies and, where appropriate, require user authorization.


10. LOCAL-FIRST ARCHITECTURE

iRiel Devices follow the PRSL-AI Local-First principle.

When a task can be processed locally with appropriate performance, privacy and reliability, local processing should be preferred.

