11. CLOUD RELATIONSHIP

Cloud is not a foundational requirement of iRiel Devices.

PRSL-AI does not define cloud storage as the default destination for user data.

PRSL-AI does not sell cloud storage as a core product.

Cloud infrastructure may be used when:

- The user chooses to use it.
- A capability requires external infrastructure.
- Synchronization is explicitly enabled.
- Backup is explicitly enabled.
- An external AI provider is authorized.
- A service cannot reasonably be performed locally.

Canonical relationship:

iRiel Device
    ≠
Cloud

Cloud
    =
